#~ "The event's **Setup** has five tabs: *Programmes* (see [Programmes]"
#~ "(programmes.md)), *Event*, *Kiosk displays* (see [Rankings and kiosk]"
#~ "(rankings-kiosk.md)), *Helpers* (see [Helpers](helpers.md)) and *Copy & "
#~ "close*. Staff only see the programmes."
